1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,067
MEN:

2
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:01,973
I'm terribly sorry,

3
00:00:01,973 --> 00:00:06,020
but I won't be able to show you the house you mentioned over the phone this morning.

4
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:09,276
The owner went away for the weekend and was supposed to be back this

5
00:00:09,276 --> 00:00:09,618
morning,

6
00:00:09,618 --> 00:00:12,833
but he just called and said he won't be back until tomorrow

7
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:14,160
because his flight got canceled.

8
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:14,804
WOMAN:

9
00:00:14,804 --> 00:00:15,871
That's terrible.

10
00:00:15,871 --> 00:00:19,050
I got off work an hour early and drove all the way across town

11
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,200
to see this house.

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,260
Isn't there any possible chance that I could at least take a look around the yard?

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:24,310
MEN:

14
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:27,965
Well, I am sure that the owner won't mind if we checked out the

15
00:00:27,965 --> 00:00:28,212
house.

16
00:00:28,212 --> 00:00:29,200
Give me a second.

17
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,433
I will call his hotel and ask for his permission.

18
00:00:32,433 --> 00:00:35,020
In the meantime, would you like some coffee?

19
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:35,385
WOMAN:

20
00:00:35,385 --> 00:00:35,751
Yes,

21
00:00:35,751 --> 00:00:37,213
that would be nice.

22
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:39,040
I take mine black, please.
